<tr><td style="padding:9px;border:1px solid #d9e6df;background:#f7faf8;font-weight:700;">Parser boundary</td><td style="padding:9px;border:1px solid #d9e6df;">UTF-8·문법·duplicate·resource limits와 raw-to-tree provenance를 소유한다.</td></tr>
