<tr><td style="padding:10px;border:1px solid #d9e6df;background:#f7faf8;font-weight:700;">먼저 수집할 증거/지표</td><td style="padding:10px;border:1px solid #d9e6df;">민감정보를 마스킹한 raw bytes/digest, parser library·version·options, duplicate pair 목록, number lexeme와 typed 값, payload bytes/depth/token/element 수, schema version, validator/backend 출력, checkpoint와 sink commit ID.</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:10px;border:1px solid #d9e6df;background:#f7faf8;font-weight:700;">가능한 가설</td><td style="padding:10px;border:1px solid #d9e6df;">First-wins/last-wins 불일치, binary64 rounding, NaN/Infinity 확장 허용, canonicalization version 차이, depth/size limit 누락, parser upgrade, UTF-8/escape 해석 차이, stream 중 side effect 발생.</td></tr>
